---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { githubUrl, linkedinUrl, showGithub } from '../lib/social-links';
---

<BaseLayout
  pageTitle="About"
  metaTitle="About | Jeremy Boyes"
  metaDescription="About Jeremy Boyes — practical technical content focused on application packaging, deployment, Intune, SCCM, and PowerShell."
  activeNav="about"
>
  <style>
    .about-page {
      padding: 1.3rem 2.3rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .about-shell {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-intro {
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      max-width: 68ch;
    }

    .about-intro:last-of-type {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.1rem;
    }

    .about-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, var(--bg));
      padding: 1.25rem 1.15rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .about-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 80%, var(--nav-active));
    }

    .about-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
      font-family: "Montserrat", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .about-card p {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .about-card p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .about-card ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .about-card li + li {
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    .about-card-wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .about-card a {
      color: var(--link-color);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .about-card a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .about-page {
        padding: 1.25rem 0 0;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="about-shell">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li class="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true">›</li>
          <li aria-current="page">About</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <section class="page-card">
        <header class="page-header">
          <h1>About</h1>
          <p>
            Practical application management for real-world environments.
          </p>
        </header>

        <p class="about-intro">
          I’m Jeremy Boyes.
        </p>

        <p class="about-intro">
          I started my IT career in Desktop Support, spending years installing software,
          troubleshooting Windows problems, and figuring out why something that worked on
          one computer wouldn’t work on another.
        </p>

        <p class="about-intro">
          That eventually led me into Application Packaging and Deployment. For more than
          20 years, I’ve packaged and deployed thousands of applications across enterprise
          environments and spent plenty of time fixing packages that didn’t work properly.
        </p>

        <p class="about-intro">
          I’ve learned just getting an application to install once isn’t enough. It needs
          to be reliable, consistent, and supportable across clean installs, upgrades and
          uninstalls.
        </p>

        <p class="about-intro">
          Today I help teams package, deploy, and manage Windows applications more
          reliably using Intune, Configuration Manager (SCCM), Windows 365, PowerShell,
          and practical automation. My focus is reducing risk, improving consistency, and
          building deployment processes that work in real environments, not just inside
          test labs.
        </p>

        <p class="about-intro">
          This is where I share the practical things I’ve learned along the way.
          Packaging tips and secrets, scripts, troubleshooting advice, and lessons from
          working with software deployments in real-world Windows environments.
        </p>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <section class="about-card">
            <h2>Topics Covered</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Application Packaging and Deployment</li>
              <li>Microsoft Intune and endpoint management</li>
              <li>Configuration Manager (SCCM)</li>
              <li>Windows 365 and Cloud PC</li>
              <li>PowerShell automation</li>
              <li>Tips and tricks, lessons learned and step by step tutorials</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="about-card">
            <h2>Certifications</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Microsoft 365 Certified: Administrator Expert</li>
              <li>Microsoft 365 Certified: Endpoint Administrator Associate</li>
              <li>Microsoft Certified: Azure AI Fundamentals</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="about-card about-card-wide">
            <h2>Connect</h2>
            <p>
              You can find me on{" "}
              {showGithub && (
                <>
                  <a href={githubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>{" "}
                  and{" "}
                </>
              )}
              <a href={linkedinUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>